Enforce Strict Safety Rule Precedence:
Healthy ML NEVER suppresses Physical Trip!" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=22;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#1E3A8A;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;fontStyle=1;shadow=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
